cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If using this research artifact, cite this version and the original BEIR/TREC-COVID sources listed in data/README.md."
type: software
title: "TREC-COVID Document Selection: Partial Reimplementation and Judgment-Coverage Diagnostic"
authors:
  - name: "QronG9"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-05
abstract: "A research artifact for independently recalculating judgment coverage, abstract-availability diagnostics, and sharp paired precision bounds from fixed retrieval rankings and original BEIR TREC-COVID judgments. It does not establish a new pooling-bias mechanism or reproduce downstream topic analysis."
keywords:
  - information retrieval
  - reproducibility
  - judgment coverage
  - TREC-COVID

